{"id": "7ddb07f8-e950-4c8a-b2af-cbd24f9d33ff", "slug": "peak-performance-recovery-2", "title": "Peak Performance & Recovery", "description": "Peak Performance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Peak Performance & Recovery\"\ndescription: \"Peak Performance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF5A1F\"\n  secondary: \"#111A17\"\n  accent: \"#8BE06E\"\n  background: \"#F3F5F2\"\n  surface: \"#111A17\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#D7DDD6\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Barlow Condensed\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Peak Performance & Recovery\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 42; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nPeak Performance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nPerformance peak Log in Athlete Rated 4.9 /5 12,408 athletes tracked Performance tech for serious training cycles Train harder. Recover faster. Peak engineers personalized training, recovery, and performance protocols b…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Train harder. Recover faster..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5A1F, secondary #111A17, accent #8BE06E, background #F3F5F2, surface #111A17, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Barlow Condensed for display moments and Space Grotesk for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Peak Performance &amp; Recovery</title>\n\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800;900&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#F3F5F2] text-[#5E6763] font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#8BE06E] selection:text-[#111A17]\">\n\n  <!-- Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"w-full relative z-50 bg-[#F3F5F2] border-b border-[#D7DDD6]\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[92rem] mx-auto px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n\n      <!-- Left Navigation Items -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n        <button class=\"text-[#111A17] hover:text-[#FF5A1F] transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2.5 cursor-pointer\">\n          <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-[#FF5A1F] shadow-sm\"></div>\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#111A17]\">\n            Performance\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Center Logo -->\n      <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 cursor-pointer\">\n        <span class=\"text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] uppercase text-[#111A17] font-['Barlow_Condensed',sans-serif]\">\n          peak\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right Auth -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-6 py-2.5 border border-[#111A17] text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#111A17] hover:bg-[#111A17] hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n          Log in\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n  <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center relative w-full max-w-[92rem] mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-4 lg:py-6\">\n\n    <!-- Hero Container -->\n    <div class=\"bg-[#E4EAE4] w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row p-8 lg:p-14 xl:p-20 gap-12 lg:gap-14 xl:gap-16 items-center border border-[#D7DDD6]\">\n\n      <!-- Left Copy -->\n      <div class=\"w-full z-20 lg:flex-[1.18] reveal-container\">\n\n        <!-- Performance Badge -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-sm feature-item\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-[#111A17] uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\">\n            <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#8BE06E]\"></span>\n            Athlete Rated\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"h-5 w-px bg-[#C8D0C8]\"></div>\n\n          <span class=\"text-[#111A17] font-bold\">4.9<span class=\"text-[#5E6763] font-medium\">/5</span></span>\n          <span class=\"text-[#5E6763] font-medium\">12,408 athletes tracked</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#FF5A1F] mb-10 uppercase tracking-[0.18em] reveal-line\">\n          Performance tech for serious training cycles\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Title & Description -->\n        <h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-7xl xl:text-8xl leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.045em] font-black uppercase font-['Barlow_Condensed',sans-serif] mb-8 max-w-[13ch]\">\n          <span class=\"block whitespace-nowrap text-[#111A17] reveal-line\">Train harder.</span>\n          <span class=\"block whitespace-nowrap text-[#FF5A1F] [text-shadow:3px_3px_0_#8BE06E] reveal-line\">Recover faster.</span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"text-lg text-[#5E6763] mb-10 max-w-[44ch] leading-relaxed font-medium reveal-line\">\n          Peak engineers personalized training, recovery, and performance protocols built around your body’s real data.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Feature List -->\n        <ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-12 feature-list\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-[#111A17] feature-item\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stopwatch-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            Optimize recovery windows by up to 30%\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-[#111A17] feature-item\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            Biometric tracking for measurable progress\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-[#111A17] feature-item\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            Direct access to elite performance coaches\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <!-- Primary CTA -->\n        <button class=\"px-9 py-4 bg-[#12261E] text-white font-black text-base uppercase tracking-[0.08em] hover:bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:text-[#111A17] transition-all shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(18,38,30,0.18)] flex items-center justify-center gap-3 cta-button\">\n          BUILD MY PLAN\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right Bento Grid Images -->\n      <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-5 relative z-10 lg:flex-[0.95] bento-grid\">\n\n        <!-- Top Wide Image -->\n        <div class=\"col-span-2 aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[16/9] lg:aspect-[1.8/1] overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm border border-[#D7DDD6] bento-img\">\n          <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/f653678a-0cd9-4568-b24e-4927b502cc46_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Athlete training on track\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n          <!-- Performance Standard Badge -->\n          <div class=\"absolute top-5 right-5 w-28 h-28 bg-[#8BE06E]/95 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center text-[#111A17] shadow-sm border border-[#111A17]/10\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-black tracking-[0.16em] uppercase leading-none mt-1\">\n              Elite\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] leading-none my-1 uppercase font-['Barlow_Condensed',sans-serif]\">\n              peak\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-black tracking-[0.16em] uppercase leading-none mb-1\">\n              Standard\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Small Metric Tag -->\n          <div class=\"absolute left-5 bottom-5 bg-[#111A17]/90 text-white px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#8BE06E] font-bold mb-1\">\n              Current block\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-sm font-bold\">\n              Speed + endurance phase\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Square Image -->\n        <div class=\"col-span-1 aspect-square overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-[#D7DDD6] relative bento-img\">\n          <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5567e848-ffe7-4b63-af8a-86aac21e43e1_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Athlete resting and recovering\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#111A17]/80 to-transparent p-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-bold\">\n              Recovery load monitored daily\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Right Square Image -->\n        <div class=\"col-span-1 aspect-square overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-[#D7DDD6] relative bento-img\">\n          <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/acb1f0dd-4d26-4610-af7a-09c5efd152cb_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Performance tracking app on mobile\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#111A17]/80 to-transparent p-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-bold\">\n              Progress measured in real time\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Bottom Performance Banner -->\n  <div class=\"w-full bg-[#F3F5F2] border-t border-[#D7DDD6] py-6 overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[92rem] mx-auto px-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-10 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\" style=\"-ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n      <!-- Feature List Row -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-10 flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold text-[#111A17] uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          Adaptive daily programming\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          Science-backed recovery\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          Integrates with your schedule\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:medal-ribbon-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          Trusted by competitive athletes\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pulse-2-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#FF5A1F]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          Built around biometric feedback\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Animation Script -->\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      // Masked Reveal Text Splitter Setup\n      const revealLines = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-line');\n      revealLines.forEach(line => {\n        const text = line.innerText;\n        line.innerHTML = '';\n        text.split(' ').forEach((word, i, arr) => {\n          const wordWrap = document.createElement('span');\n          wordWrap.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n          wordWrap.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          wordWrap.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n\n          const wordInner = document.createElement('span');\n          wordInner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          wordInner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n          wordInner.innerText = word;\n          wordInner.classList.add('word-inner');\n\n          wordWrap.appendChild(wordInner);\n          line.appendChild(wordWrap);\n\n          // Preserve spaces\n          if (i < arr.length - 1) {\n            line.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n          }\n        });\n      });\n\n      // Animate Masked Text\n      gsap.to('.reveal-container .word-inner', {\n        y: '0%',\n        duration: 0.8,\n        stagger: 0.05,\n        ease: 'power3.out',\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: '.reveal-container',\n          start: 'top 85%'\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Animate Features List\n      gsap.from('.feature-item', {\n        x: -20,\n        opacity: 0,\n        duration: 0.6,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        ease: 'power2.out',\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: '.reveal-container',\n          start: 'top 85%'\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Animate Bento Images\n      gsap.from('.bento-img', {\n        scale: 1.05,\n        opacity: 0,\n        duration: 1,\n        stagger: 0.15,\n        ease: 'power3.out',\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: '.bento-grid',\n          start: 'top 85%'\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Animate CTA Button\n      gsap.from('.cta-button', {\n        y: 20,\n        opacity: 0,\n        duration: 0.6,\n        delay: 0.4,\n        ease: 'power2.out',\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: '.reveal-container',\n          start: 'top 85%'\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "peak-performance-recovery-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/peak-performance-recovery-2.jpg", "source_name": "peak-performance-recovery-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 129, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:58:32.5052+00:00"}